---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import ProgramPage from "../../layouts/ProgramPage.astro";

const highPerformanceBuildingsPosts = await getCollection(
  "programPost",
  ({ data }) => {
    return data.programArea.includes("High Performance Buildings");
  }
);

const pageTitle = "High Performance Buildings";

const highPerformanceBuildingsAreas = [
  {
    title: "Regulations, Guidance, and Policy",
    children: [
      { title: "Executive Orders" },
      { title: "Guiding Principles and LEED" },
      { title: "Agency-Specific Policy" },
      { title: "Guidance and Policy" },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "Supporting Information and Tools",
    children: [
      { title: "Databases and Software Tools" },
      { title: "Directories, Catalogs, and Newsletters" },
      { title: "Libraries and Repositories" },
      { title: "Organizations and Programs" },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "Lessons Learned",
    children: [
      { title: "Award Winners" },
      { title: "Beneficial Landscaping" },
      { title: "Case Studies" },
      { title: "Construction Design" },
      { title: "Construction Guidelines and Criteria" },
      { title: "Indoor Air Quality" },
      { title: "Planning" },
    ],
  },
  { title: "Training, Presentations, and Briefings" },
  { title: "Conferences and Events" },
];
---

<ProgramPage
  programAreas={highPerformanceBuildingsAreas}
  posts={highPerformanceBuildingsPosts}
  pageTitle={pageTitle}
>
  <p>
    Included in the High Performance Buildings Program Area are links to, and
    highlights from, the U.S. Green Building Council (USGBC), the Leadership in
    Energy and Environmental Design (LEED) Green Building Rating System,<sup
      >TM
    </sup>case studies of green construction efforts, software and databases to
    aid in determining which construction products and processes are the most
    effective, and assorted high performance construction guidelines and
    standards.
  </p>
  <p>
    When future Executive Orders (EOs) and Implementing Instructions for those
    EOs are released addressing federal facilities the text on this page will be
    updated.
  </p>
</ProgramPage>
